<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-27T19:31:41.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:31:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Intensified drone attacks by the Rapid Support Forces have hit Nyala, killing at least 21 people, injuring 40 and knocking out power in southeast Sudan, worsening civilian hardship. The Sudanese Armed Forces and allied militias continue to grind the conflict, while women under siege are increasingly acting as frontline responders to meet basic needs. Hundreds of thousands of Sudanese refugees are now hosted in Chad as the regional humanitarian emergency expands. The United Nations warns of a looming famine risk as the war grinds on, and the conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj5ynkk6v3pzo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2026/10/27/sudans-war-steals-childrens-futures-with-school-closures-and-displacement?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQNFpfcVFSbjd3ZDV1YkotWjllNm1DekY4YnNtSzEzNGlZT0lDcHNXWVdUT1dvQTFSdDhXbnVIV1dWRTdXNnM1TkFkckUzZkFibzFmVnFYU0dMRG9DYTdNQkk5c2hGYWpDdWtIOUZhUDVFYXVrVzlmNWlQOU1mTFFoY0hJWEt5bmlybDhSbGNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBlSHNHalpnOFV4XzNqM0czOVl3Z3lzN0ZERGJjQjZXVllJdkF4ZjFoRnMyWGlDaGlxWEl1S1FETXFtOWJLNUdleQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
